  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call-off from framework agreement ISK audit of Rwanda Legal Aid Forum 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK-granskning fr&#xe5;n rangordnat ramavtal av Rwanda Legal Aid Forum 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag syftar till att utv&#xe4;rdera Legal Aid Forums system f&#xf6;r intern styrning och kontroll. Konsulten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter och l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer avseende f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar. Baserat p&#xe5; resultaten kan Sida komma att kr&#xe4;va att Legal Aid Forum &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rdar vissa svagheter innan ett eventuellt avtal kan undertecknas och/eller att &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder inkluderas som avtalsvillkor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at reviewing the system for internal control of Legal Aid Forum The consultant is expected to identify any possible weaknesses and make recommendations for improvement. Based on the findings, Sida may require that Legal Aid Forum addresses identified weaknesses prior to a potential agreement and/or add some of the measures as agreement conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
